silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_06_unit_leg_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "UnitLegYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_06_unit_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'UnitLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Unit Leg', the unit_attribution_arrow Unit_grams -> WeightMeas_3450g: Unit_grams contextualizes this measurement event as a gram-valued weighing; Unit_grams is shared across many measurement events, so the arrow is not monic.; also, In 'Unit Leg', the si_typing_arrow records that Unit_grams is typed under SI_MassUnit; SI_MassUnit is shared by all SI mass units (grams, kilograms, milligrams), so this arrow is not monic." .
